ad77944f1b46a06478ba47c50413d 3x"}, "body": "Hello, \u5c0f\u7530\u3055\u3093!\nThank you for the previous illustration! I really love your expressive color work and how you depict the character's eye!\n\nThis time, I would like to request an illustration of my character, Borealis.\n\nBorealis is a quiet and docile boy who often dresses like a female. He has a pair of eyes that resemble aurora-colored jewels. \n\nHe is the guardian deity of a country that became ruined after a war. Despite being the only living being left in the country, he takes his job quite seriously and works non-stop to attempt to purify the land that is now filled with hateful spirits and residual thoughts left by people who past away due to the war.\n\nPlease feel free to draw him in any expression and pose.\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11OhdrMoTo8_iCWGlXfJLDJja8Gdmg6OA?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oda_koden/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1700697, "client_id": 2244237, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01973d4517d614e2d72c3edf3ff7a5b1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01973d4517d614e2d72c3edf3ff7a5b1, https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ae61846129234c4a73331d66aab874b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3acf3dcf15ecc710d07638